expected: 94dd9e08c129c785f7f256e82fbe0a30e6d1ae40
  actual: a57f26a28863c3e7cdd7a8ce7dec82c5ccbb715

Godbolt: https://godbolt.org/z/dfq17bvef

How can I fix these two issues?

